  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed ground floor side and rear extension by reason of its size and scale,&nbsp; would result in a harmful impact on the amenities of the neighbouring occupiers at No. 87 and No.83 Ravensdale Road by way of a loss of outlook, loss of daylight and sunlight, and would have an overbearing impact.&nbsp; As such, the proposed development is contrary to policies D6 (Housing quality and standards) of the London Plan (2021), policy LP2 (Development and Amenity) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020), and the guidance contained within Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2009).&nbsp;",
    "The proposal, by reason of poor outlook and light serving the new basement accommodation, would provide a sub-standard form of accommodation to the detriment of future occupiers, contrary to policy D6 (Housing quality and standards) of the London Plan (2021), policy LP17 (Housing Design) of the Hackney Local Plan LP33 (2020), the Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD 2009 and the&amp;nbsp;Technical housing standards – nationally described space standards 2015."
